00:38:20.070 --> 00:38:22.450
I really had no place to go.

00:38:22.450 --> 00:38:24.330
I had set myself up with my brand.

00:38:24.330 --> 00:38:26.693
So, I want, from that I want you to

00:38:26.693 --> 00:38:30.455
think very carefully about the brand you
want to have.

00:38:30.455 --> 00:38:33.162
The last story is one that I think you'll
remember.

00:38:33.162 --> 00:38:34.549
&gt;&gt; So what happened?

00:38:34.549 --> 00:38:36.777
&gt;&gt; We ended up in four years of
