brand

00:39:08.739 --> 00:39:11.450
I had before, which was the guy will never
sue.

00:39:11.450 --> 00:39:13.490
He will never get into litigation.

00:39:13.490 --> 00:39:17.356
So, you really wanna think carefully,
because that brand, and part

00:39:17.356 --> 00:39:21.150
of my message, here is that there are no
episodic negotiations.

00:39:21.150 --> 00:39:23.680
You may think it's an episode.

00:39:23.680 --> 00:39:27.450
You may think you're going in and having a
one-off, deal with somebody.

00:39:27.450 --> 00:39:30.655
That person talks to somebody else who
talks to somebody else who talks to

00:39:30.655 --> 00:39:34.240
somebody else, and pretty soon everything
is we live in a very connected world.

00:39:35.760 --> 00:39:36.860
So think carefully.

00:39:36.860 --> 00:39:39.579
If you're doing a lot of negotiation for a

00:39:39.579 --> 00:39:43.710
living, think very carefully about the
brand you wanna have.

